  "description": "ONE MR FULL CARBON INTEGRATED The new OИE MR full carbon fold integrated, is designed for the MTB Racing world. Stem and hadlebar are integrated in a single structure that guarantees maximum cable integration, with an obvious advantage in terms of rigidity, comfort and a record-breaking aerodynamics. Standard on all versions. AVAILABLE SIZES: 780 x 70/80\n\nREPARTO CORSE TECHNOLOGIES GARDENA 29 with the Monolith Superlight frame is the full suspension developed by Red Lab to create the fastest and most precise MTB ever with incredible performance even on the hardest routes. The MONOLITH monocoque full carbon frame is made with the total absence of juncture points thanks to a single mold that allows the carbon fibers to be distributed evenly, guaranteeing greater resistance and lower weight. The 12mm thru axle with a 148mm wheelbase keeps the rear rigid both in the hardest sections and in the most demanding changes in pace, while the racing set-up allows you to maximize the cyclist's capabilities and maximize performance with every pedal stroke. IDEAL FOR Dedicated to the world of competitions, GARDENA 29 is designed for cross country use. Designed to travel on trails at high speeds, it guarantees high control both on climbs and more technical descents. PERFECT FOR YOU IF If you are looking for a fast bike to cover the greatest number of trails. GARDENA 29 is designed for bikers looking for a fast and reactive vehicle to dominate even the toughest tracks. Efficient uphill but also stable downhill, it guarantees reliable and controlled driving.",
